{"edition_id":"urn:uuid:35b4350d-7202-5d47-8b85-5262d7ca441c","id":"urn:uuid:02379e29-d68e-59ff-928a-33226f7c98ab","order":3,"protected_tokens":[{"command_kind":"href","header":"CommandInset href","kind":"CommandInset","ordinal":1,"sha256":"7e940325a54704c5fd448c7b4a6320401759f6b4b4a5738de1b0107d47349d6c","target":"http://nm.mathforcollege.com/"}],"record_type":"segment","rights_id":"urn:uuid:52a7c815-5b13-5f21-a52a-e7fa11238e07","schema_id":"ttna-segment-v1","schema_version":"1.0.0","semantic_slot":"paragraph","source_block_sha256":"286c2dc20eaaa919b44ca6d2cfc7509934927da003300dc24904fe62b40e844c","source_file_id":"urn:uuid:271e812b-1ccd-53ed-a402-07fe58709c8a","source_locale":"en-US","source_locator":{"end_line":183,"layout":"Standard","layout_ordinal":4,"start_line":147},"source_text":"Greetings! And thanks for giving Tea Time Numerical Analysis a read. This textbook was born of a desire to contribute a viable, completely free, introductory Numerical Analysis textbook for instructors and students of mathematics. When this project began (summer 2012), there were traditionally published (very expensive hardcover) textbooks, notably the excellent Numerical Analysis by Burden and Faires, which was in its ninth edition. As you might guess by the number of editions, this text is a classic. It is one of very few numerical analysis textbooks geared for the mathematician, not the scientist or engineer. In fact, I studied from an early edition in the mid 1990's! Also in the summer of 2012 there were a couple of freely available websites, notably the popular {{HREF:1}}, complete with video lectures. However, no resource I could find included a complete, single-pdf downloadable textbook designed for mathematics classes. To be just that is the ultimate goal of Tea Time Numerical Analysis.","source_text_sha256":"a0328147f8c3efbfd40bf56b22b3342afa0b07adc3802083d18b7dbba48fca79","translation_state":"source_frozen","unit_id":"urn:uuid:a89488a5-e6d2-538c-84eb-b3b0d487a49f"}
{"edition_id":"urn:uuid:35b4350d-7202-5d47-8b85-5262d7ca441c","id":"urn:uuid:079e81c3-a418-505b-8fa4-d2f53bf8a71c","order":1,"protected_tokens":[],"record_type":"segment","rights_id":"urn:uuid:52a7c815-5b13-5f21-a52a-e7fa11238e07","schema_id":"ttna-segment-v1","schema_version":"1.0.0","semantic_slot":"title","source_block_sha256":"cfc412d919c9d972b3f7ade30ee243cb49833cf555a9896685123ee4fe1fc13e","source_file_id":"urn:uuid:271e812b-1ccd-53ed-a402-07fe58709c8a","source_locale":"en-US","source_locator":{"end_line":104,"layout":"Chapter*","layout_ordinal":1,"start_line":102},"source_text":"Preface","source_text_sha256":"7a931891ebbb61a7201470a43a8d9ce76bba4d3e147b44af701917422ef5e81f","translation_state":"source_frozen","unit_id":"urn:uuid:b00f7eba-fa8c-533b-bbdf-281ef37c8daf"}
